//     guest-page fault) that writes a guest virtual address to mtval, GVA is set to 1. For any
//     other trap into M-mode, GVA is set to 0.
//
// Context:
//   medeleg = 0 (M-mode boot). HLV/HSV from M-mode access guest virtual addresses.
//
